@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="bevo-card">
    <div class="text-center">
        <h1 class="bevo-headline-page text-bevo-orange">
            🌮 Privacy Policy
            <span class="bevo-underline bevo-underline-page bevo-underline-orange"></span>
        </h1>
    </div>

    <p>At Bevo's Tacos, we take your privacy as seriously as we take our salsa. Here's how we handle your information:</p>

    <h4 class="text-bevo-maroon">What We Collect</h4>
    <p>Walk-up orders need nothing but an optional first name. Catering customers create an account with a first name, email, password and customer code, and we keep each order's items, event date, guest count and delivery address.</p>

    <h4 class="text-bevo-maroon">How We Use It</h4>
    <p>We use your order information to price your order, cook it, deliver it, and show you your order history. Passwords are stored as salted hashes, never in plain text. We do not sell, rent, or share your information with third parties.</p>

    <h4 class="text-bevo-maroon">A Note on This Demo</h4>
    <p>This site is a portfolio project. Please don't enter real addresses or reuse a real password here.</p>

    <h4 class="text-bevo-maroon">Questions?</h4>
    <p>If you have any questions about how we handle your information, feel free to stop by the truck and ask us directly!</p>
</div>
